  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Version: 2014.4.1\nPictures taken using the profile picture camera are stretched when viewed on the social screen.\n--------------------------------\nTo Reproduce:\nHave VRC+\nGo to profile, click \"Change Profile Pic\". Select \"Take new photo\".\nTake a picture using the profile picture camera.\nSet it as your profile picture.\nCheck the social menu, your profile picture will be stretched wider than it should.\n--------------------------------\nThe picture will also be stretched if you view it in the \"gallery\" section.\nThis does not happen with an existing picture I took this way before the quick menu UI and camera update. (2021.4.1)\nThe image is also stretched on VRC Home in the Profile and Gallery views, but not on the left-hand sidebar.\nPictures should either be cropped correctly in all places, or the profile picture camera should take pictures of appropriate resolution for where they are used.",
